<title>SWITZERLAND: Swissair starts service to Sarajevo.</title>
<headline>Swissair starts service to Sarajevo.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swissair, the main airline of the SAirGroup, said it was starting a three times weekly service to the Bosnian capital of Sarajevo from Zurich from June 9.</p>
<p>The service on Mondays, Wednesdays and Fridays, will originate in Zurich and be operated by regional airline Crossair AG with a AvroRJ85 Jumbolino aircraft.</p>
<p>The service is still subject to approval by the governmental authorities concerned.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
